"""Layer-0 MLP down-projection, component 4247: a detector for words meaning "one individual".

The component reads the current token only. When that token is a word about a single person
or individual, it writes a positive value into the residual stream, larger the more strictly
it means one individual:
  - "individual" (and 个人, 個人, 개인) is the strongest;
  - "individuals", "personal" and their derivatives come next;
  - "person", "single" (one person on their own) come after that;
  - other people-words (people, someone, everyone) and "professional", "profile" are weak;
  - reflexives and "own" ("self", "myself", "themselves", "own", "自己") are weak.
Every other token gets 0. The values are the typical activations measured on training text.
"""

